OL,3,GNEWSAScotland to observe two-minute
OL,4,Asilence on Remembrance Sunday
OL,5,
OL,6,FCommunities across Scotland will mark
OL,7,FRemembrance Sunday with a two-minute
OL,8,Fsilence later, honouring those who have
OL,9,Fdied serving their country.
OL,11,FCommemorations in the capital will
OL,12,Fbegin with a military parade from
OL,13,FEdinburgh Castle down the Royal Mile,
OL,14,Fled by the RAF Central Scotland Pipes
OL,15,Fand Drums.
OL,17,FVeterans, serving members of the armed
OL,18,Fforces and senior politicians will then
OL,19,Fpause at the stone of remembrance to
OL,20,Fobserve the two-minute silence.
OL,23,APub: 08-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
