OL,3,GNEWSAScotland to observe two-minute
OL,4,Asilence on Remembrance Sunday
OL,5,
OL,6,FServices will also take place in
OL,7,FGlasgow in the newly-reopened George
OL,8,FSquare and in Dundee's garden of
OL,9,Fremembrance as well as in many other
OL,10,Ftowns and cities across the country.
